LirBlock__clone / LirInst__drop inside lir_codegen___emit_call_extern_with —
the Rust-gg-compiled stage-0 deep-clones a whole LirFunction per extern-call arg-type
lookup (lir_codegen.gg:4601-4603 m.functions.get(callee_idx).unwrap().params...,
